---
import church from '../../inputs/church.json';
import ActionLink from '../components/ActionLink.astro';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import ContentSection from '../components/ContentSection.astro';
---
<Page title={"Prayer & Pastoral Care"}>
  <ContentSection>
    <p>Prayer is at the centre of everything we do as a church. Our Sunday services are based on The Book of Common Prayer, and they are designed as participatory training for a whole life of prayer. We are always happy to pray for you and with you. </p>
  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>What do you need prayer for?</h2>
    <ActionLink href={`mailto:${church.email}`}>Email a prayer request</ActionLink>
    <h2>Our Pastoral Care team are here for you</h2>
    <p>Our ministers do a lot of different things in their roles, but one of their highest priorities and greatest joys is to meet with people individually to provide counsel and prayer. </p>
    <p>Whether you’re struggling with your mental health, having conflict in a relationship, facing a sticky situation at work, or for whatever other reason – we’re here for you. Email us to make a time to meet.</p>
  </ContentSection>
</Page>
